```rust
struct Session;
struct Authenticator {
    session: Option<Session>,
}
impl Authenticator {
    // Hidden side effect: mutates state and creates a temporal ordering
    fn check_password(&mut self, pass: &str) -> bool {
        if pass == "secret" {
            self.session = Some(Session);
            true
        } else {
            false
        }
    }
}
```

fix:
Separate the check from the mutation, making the state transition explicit.
```rust
impl Authenticator {
    fn is_password_valid(&self, pass: &str) -> bool {
        pass == "secret"
    }
    fn initialize_session(&mut self) {
        self.session = Some(Session);
    }
}
```
